{    "name": "laravel/laravel",    "description": "The Laravel Framework.",    "keywords": ["framework", "laravel"],    "license": "MIT",    "type": "project",    "require": {        "php": ">=8.2",        "barryvdh/laravel-dompdf": "^3.0",        "brian2694/laravel-toastr": "^5.57",        "guzzlehttp/guzzle": "^7.2",        "laravel/framework": "^12.0",        "laravel/helpers": "^1.7",        "laravel/tinker": "^2.9",        "laravel/ui": "^4.6",        "nekhbet/laravel-collective-html": "*",        "maatwebsite/excel": "^3.1"    },    "require-dev": {        "doctrine/dbal": "^3.0",        "fakerphp/faker": "^1.23",        "mockery/mockery": "^1.6",        "phpunit/phpunit": "^11.0"    },    "autoload": {        "classmap": [            "database"        ],        "psr-4": {            "App\\": "app/"        }    },    "autoload-dev": {        "psr-4": {            "Tests\\": "tests/"        }    },    "scripts": {        "post-autoload-dump": [            "Illuminate\\Foundation\\ComposerScripts::postAutoloadDump",            "@php artisan package:discover"        ],        "post-root-package-install": [            "@php -r \"file_exists('.env') || copy('.env.example', '.env');\""        ],        "post-create-project-cmd": [            "@php artisan key:generate"        ]    },    "config": {        "preferred-install": "dist",        "sort-packages": true,        "allow-plugins": {            "kylekatarnls/update-helper": true        }    }}